{
  "id": "ana10-c6-s1-n77",
  "card_id": "ana10-c6-s1-n77",
  "chapter": "第六章 三角函数及其图象和导数（续）",
  "section": "§ 15. 三角函数的导函数",
  "number": "77",
  "title": "三角函数的连续性",
  "printed_title": "77$^{*}$. 三角函数的连续性",
  "start_page": 13,
  "start_printed": 7,
  "figures": [
    {
      "id": "fig-03",
      "label": "图 3",
      "page": 13
    }
  ],
  "exercise_count": 0,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在第75小节里，我们提出了关于函数 $\\cos$ 连续性的假设.现在证明这个假设以及函数 $\\sin$、$\\operatorname{tg}$、$\\operatorname{ctg}$ 在它们有定义的所有各点的连续性. 为此，我们需要下面的预备定理.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 7,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0013#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "预备定理　对于满足条件$0<|x|<\\frac{\\pi}{2}$所有 $x$ 的值，不等式$|\\sin x|<|x|<|\\operatorname{tg}x|$　(1)成立.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 7,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0013#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "现在从 $0<x<\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ 的情形开始证明. 我们来比较面积 $S_{OAD}$（三角形$OAD$）、$S_{OAB}$（三角形 $OAB$）和 $S_{OACD}$（扇形 $OACD$）（图 3）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 7,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0013#7",
        "p0013#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-03",
      "label": "图 3",
      "printed_page": 7,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0013#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 3",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 3",
      "printed_page": 7,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0013#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这些面积很容易算出：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 7,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0013#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$S_{OAD}=\\frac{1}{2}|OA|\\cdot|OD|\\cdot\\sin x=\\frac{1}{2}\\sin x$，$S_{OAB}=\\frac{1}{2}|OA|\\cdot|AB|=\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{tg}x$，$S_{OACD}=\\frac{1}{2}r^2\\cdot x=\\frac{1}{2}x$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 7,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0013#12",
        "p0014#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "*　划星号的是补充教材，不要求全体学生都学习. 在许多情况下，这种补充教材划两个三角形：$\\blacktriangleright$（在开头部分），$\\blacktriangleleft$（在末尾部分），参看第13—15页等等.",
      "id": null,
      "label": "note",
      "printed_page": 7,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0013#13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由图 3 看出，$S_{OAD}<S_{OACD}<S_{OAB}$，或$\\frac{1}{2}\\sin x<\\frac{1}{2}x<\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{tg}x$，就是$\\sin x<x<\\operatorname{tg}x$.　(2)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 8,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0014#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为当 $0<x<\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ 时，$\\sin x$ 和 $\\operatorname{tg}x$ 都是正的，所以当 $0<x<\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ 时，不等式(1)成立.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 8,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0014#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "剩下的问题是讨论 $-\\frac{\\pi}{2}<x<0$ 的情形. 当 $x$ 取这些值时，得 $0<-x<\\frac{\\pi}{2}$，并且对于 $-x$ 可以利用不等式(2)：$\\sin(-x)<-x<\\operatorname{tg}(-x)$.　(3)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 8,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0014#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为现在 $-x=|x|$，$\\sin(-x)=|\\sin x|$，$\\operatorname{tg}(-x)=|\\operatorname{tg}x|$，那么由(3)可以得出(1).",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 8,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0014#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这样，对于区间 $]-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}[$ 里所有 $x\\ne0$ 的值，完全证明了不等式(1).",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 8,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0014#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "定理 1　在整个数轴上，余弦函数是连续的，也就是对于任意 $x_0\\in R$，$\\lim_{x\\to x_0}\\cos x=\\cos x_0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 8,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0014#7"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
